     "html": "<p>Hi {{ contact.firstname }},</p>\n<div data-block-id=\"block-1b650049-baea-4309-ac66-f28753056020\">\n<p>We noticed you haven\u2019t yet explored the essential guides we shared a few days ago. To help you understand the incredible opportunities private labeling can offer, we\u2019d like to provide more information about the benefits of partnering with <span style=\"background:#FFF3CD;border-bottom:2px solid #8A6300;\" data-praxera-review=\"brand\">Praxera</span>.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"font-size: 16px; line-height: 175%;\"><strong>The Benefits of Private Labeling with <span style=\"background:#FFF3CD;border-bottom:2px solid #8A6300;\" data-praxera-review=\"brand\">Praxera</span>:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Brand Ownership</strong>: Create and control your own brand without the need for extensive R&amp;D and manufacturing investments.<br><br></li>\n<li><strong>Higher Profit Margins</strong>: Enjoy higher profit margins compared to reselling third-party products.<br><br></li>\n<li><strong>Market Differentiation</strong>: Stand out in the market with unique, high-quality supplements that reflect your brand\u2019s values and mission.<br><br></li>\n<li><strong>Customer Loyalty</strong>: Build a loyal customer base with exclusive products that are only available through your brand.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Are you ready to unlock new opportunities and elevate your brand with premium private label supplements? <a href=\"https://www.praxerasupplements.com/en/pl-demo-get-started\" style=\"font-weight: bold;\" rel=\"noopener\">Schedule a free consultation</a> with our team today and let\u2019s discuss how we can help you achieve your business goals.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Don't forget to check out our <a href=\"https://www.praxerasupplements.com/en/pl-demo-resources\" style=\"font-weight: bold;\" rel=\"noopener\">Private Label Resource Center</a> to gain more insights that can help you on your journey!</p>\n</div>",
     "module_id": 1155639
    },
